The first place I would try is looking at the jumpers - what you want
is to make sure it's not trying to send bootup stuff to com1.  The
design guide that should have come with the MB should have the
locations and settings of these jumpers (if you didn't get the design
guide, check out:
http://ftp.digital.com/pub/DEC/axppci/read_me.html
)

Since you said you're used to using PCs, I think you'll also find:
http://www.azstarnet.com/~axplinux/
very interesting and helpful.  Note, however, that the boot sequence
is vastly different on an Alpha than on a PC.  If you need more help
feel free to email.

